--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data source  : 1 read bound as StateFlow via BatteryCellsPageViewModel -> batteryCellsPageSourceOf(): the page-local
               BatteryCellsExtrasRepository.batteryCells over the shared ApiHttpClient + CacheStore (web bare useQuery
               /analytics/battery-cells). Scope = SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle); units = SettingsStore.settings()
               (web useUnits). No HTTP in the view; decode JsonElement -> BatteryCellData in the framework-free model.
charts       : 2x BarChartWrapper + 2x LineChartWrapper + ChartContainer wrapping AreaChartWrapper from the A3
               components.charts (Vico) library — Compose-native, never a webview. The web's horizontal ReferenceLines
               (avg/min/max on the bar chart; nominal/warning on the imbalance + spread charts) are reproduced as inline
               reference captions, since the A3 cartesian wrappers anchor markers on the x-axis.
si/units     : SI read off the wire; avg/min/max temperature via the shared formatTemperature(convertTempFromSI) at the
               display boundary (prefs.temperature); temp-spread is a delta scaled by 9/5 for °F with no +32 offset
               (prefs.temperatureSpread). No °F stored or computed. Voltages (V) + the imbalance/spread (mV) + cell counts
               are unit-less scalars rendered verbatim (web parity); the V/mV unit symbols are hard literals, never i18n.
states       : battery-cells is the PRIMARY gate (loading/empty/error/success). Each section renders its own
               content-or-empty surface, so no section is ever hidden (web per-section truthiness). Documented divergence
               (Honesty #9): an all-empty / no-vehicle payload routes to the friendly empty surface via the model hasData gate.
a11y/theme   : the spread-trend chart carries accessibleDescription (web aria-label); heatmap tiles carry per-cell
               contentDescription; the page root carries the title semantics; icons decorative (contentDescription=null);
               all color via MaterialTheme.colorScheme + chart ChartPalette(paletteColor) + TeslaTokens.status (A2 tokens) —
               dynamic color + dark theme; typography via the role components (PageTitle/PanelTitle/BodyText/Caption/
               MetricValue/MetricLabel/HelperText/CodeText). Compose-native (no webview).
nav          : Destinations 'batteryCells' -> /battery-cells pre-existing (Destinations.kt L80, count unchanged); host
               wired via PageHosts.register("batteryCells"); deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost.
strings      : 28 page literal keys + battery.cells.chart.spreadTrend.aria added to res/values/strings.xml; the other
               ~40 battery.cells.* keys + the common chrome keys (freshness/common/error) + the status labels already
               present. Resource names follow gen-i18n androidName() (non-[A-Za-z0-9_] -> '_'). MissingTranslation/
               ExtraTranslation disabled in lint (the ar/he catalogs ship English fallbacks), so base-only adds are clean.
placeholder  : PLACEHOLDER_ALLOWED=0  PLACEHOLDER_COUNT=0  (Int->Double widened via *1.0, not .toDouble(), so the scan's
